# The preposition the week phrases take: Russian frames a relative week with
# "на" and the prepositional case, where the month and year take "в".
# CLDR 47 gives "на прошлой неделе", "на этой неделе", "на следующей неделе"
# for the ru week field (cldr-dates-full/main/ru/dateFields.json,
# week relative-type--1/0/1).
на
